  "rulesText": "Mark a Stress to transform into a hulking nature spirit, gaining the following benefits:\n\n  - When you succeed on an attack or Spellcast Roll, gain a +10 bonus to the damage roll.\n\n  - When you deal enough damage to defeat a creature within\n\nClose range, you absorb them and clear an Armor Slot.\n\n  - You can’t be Restrained.\n\nBefore you make an action roll, you must spend a Hope. If you can’t, you revert to your normal form.",
